@startuml
actor Mobile
participant Nginx
participant Controller
participant UseCase
participant Domain
participant Repository
database PostGIS

Mobile -> Nginx: HTTPS
Nginx -> Controller: REST
Controller -> UseCase: Command/Query
UseCase -> Domain: business rules
UseCase -> Repository: port
Repository -> PostGIS: SQL/spatial
PostGIS --> Repository: result
Repository --> UseCase
UseCase --> Controller
Controller --> Mobile: JSON
@enduml
